  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "3C9F1C86B3D9A181",
      "text": "歡迎光臨冰櫃道館！\\n要再聽一次道館測驗的說明嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "3C9F1986B3D99C68",
      "text": "冰櫃道館的道館測驗是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]開場表演[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！\\r\\n……也就是所謂的暖場秀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "3C9F1A86B3D99E1B",
      "text": "在道館館主的演唱會開始之前，\\n請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在舞台上進行寶可夢對戰！\\r\\n用火花四濺的決鬥炒熱觀眾席！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "3C9F1F86B3D9A69A",
      "text": "只要到演唱會場和主持人說一聲，\\n就可以開始道館測驗囉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_01",
      "hash64": "75CFDD5A7E891CA8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳來啦！負責暖場的訓練家！\\n我的名字叫ＭＣ卡蒙！\\r\\n演唱會的會場在這邊喔！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_02",
      "hash64": "75CFE05A7E8921C1",
      "text": "接下來要請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n同時派出２隻寶可夢，\\r\\n進行雙打對戰！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
