    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_04",
      "hash64": "75CFE25A7E892527",
      "text": "只要[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能打出轟動全場的雙打對戰，\\n讓場上刺激雙倍，觀眾熱度翻倍！\\r\\n現場就會分貝加倍！冰櫃也會雪融成水！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_05",
      "hash64": "75CFE15A7E892374",
      "text": "只要讓演唱會場氣氛熱起來，\\n館主高高興興上台！\\r\\n道館測驗就算通過啦！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_19",
      "hash64": "75CC615A7E86141D",
      "text": "站上舞台，好戲就開場囉！\\n要是沒有連贏３場，一律不准中途退場！\\r\\n挑戰時可要做好覺悟啊！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_06",
      "hash64": "75CFE45A7E89288D",
      "text": "開場表演＆道館測驗！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好要轟動全場了嗎！？[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "DD14BEA998FA3570",
      "text": "準備好了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
