          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_20",
      "hash64": "75C8D25A7E82EB49",
      "text": "各位先生女士！\\n本次演唱會的開場表演是由\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]帶來的雙打對戰３連戰～！！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
