    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "A6867CAD00457FC3",
      "text": "觀眾席的歡呼聲\\n稍微變大了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_22",
      "hash64": "75C8D05A7E82E7E3",
      "text": "冰櫃舞台用的是最新技術！\\n觀眾越是火熱，\\r\\n舞台的燈就會越亮眼！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
