      "label": "gym_ghost_020_musician_01",
      "hash64": "FA28AE5C2161A7D7",
      "text": "互補弱點，變得強大！\\n這就是２隻寶可夢齊聲呈現的和聲！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_system_02",
      "hash64": "A6867DAD00458176",
      "text": "觀眾席籠罩在\\n火熱的氣氛中！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_26",
      "hash64": "75C8D45A7E82EEAF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的表演讓現場的\\n歡呼聲和燈光都變得越來越熱鬧啦～！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
