    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "38CC8D00F77B221B",
      "text": "高分貝的歡呼！讓我感到嫉妒！\\n你是高興得想哭，還是樂得想跳舞！？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mobs_04",
      "hash64": "FF74B4E15C0EF3C6",
      "text": "Yeah！！想跳舞～！！\\n萊姆！萊姆！萊姆！萊姆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "38CC9200F77B2A9A",
      "text": "寶貝，謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳開場！\\n只要我來了，就不會無聊囉！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
